<h2 id="dr-when" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">1. When this applies</h2>

| Trigger | Meaning |
|---------|---------|
| **`delivery-resumimpl`** | User names **`docs/plans/<feature>-plan.md`** (or spec `<!-- plan: … -->` target). Execute from first **`[ ]`**. |
| **`resumimpl docs/plans/…`** | Same as **`delivery-resumimpl`** when the path is under **`docs/plans/`**. |
| **`Run bootstrap/EXECUTE_GEN.md …`** (resume) | Before coding: open linked **`docs/plans/*-plan.md`**, honor **`[X]`**, continue from first **`[ ]`**. |

If ambiguous, ask **one** question: which **`docs/plans/*.md`** is the delivery ledger?

---

<h2 id="dr-shape" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">2. Plan shape</h2>

Delivery plans **must** match **`docs/templates/implementation-plan.md`**:

- Top: **`<!-- delivery-status: new|wip|completed -->`**, **`<!-- plan-for: docs/specs/… -->`**
- Phases **`### P1` … `### Pn`** with **Execution checklist** bullets **`[ ]` / `[X]`**
- Phase heading may prefix **`[X]`** when **all** checklist bullets in that phase are **`[X]`**
- **Exit** / **ACs** / **HG-*** prose stays; checkboxes are the human-visible progress bar

**Canonical path:** always **`docs/plans/<feature>-plan.md`** (spec `<!-- plan: -->` must keep pointing here). Do **not** move the only copy into **`wip/`**.

---

<h2 id="dr-procedure" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">3. Procedure</h2>

1. Open the delivery plan and spec linked by **`<!-- plan-for: -->`** / spec **`<!-- plan: -->`**.
2. If checklists missing, normalize per **`docs/templates/implementation-plan.md`** before implementing.
3. Set **`<!-- delivery-status: wip -->`** when marking the first implementable **`[X]`** (if still **`new`**).
4. Implement the **first phase** that has any **`[ ]`**, in **P1 → Pn** order; respect **`implement-feature`** and **HG-*** stops.
5. After each checklist item completes: edit plan → **`[X]`**; after phase **Exit**: prefix phase **`[X]`** if all bullets done; append spec **`## Decisions`** when gates or ambiguities require it.
6. Run phase **Exit** verify commands before ticking verify-related boxes.
7. When **every** implementable checklist item is **`[X]`** (or waived with one-line rationale in the plan): set **`<!-- delivery-status: completed -->`**; optional [folder archive](#dr-folders).

**Blockers:** same as **`EXECUTE_GEN.md`** agent mandate — stop with numbered human steps; leave boxes **`[ ]`**.

---

<h2 id="dr-folders" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">4. Optional folder archive</h2>

| Path | Use |
|------|-----|
| **`docs/plans/wip/`** | Optional **read-only snapshot** when human wants a dated copy mid-flight — **not** the live ledger. |
| **`docs/plans/completed/`** | Optional archive copy when **`delivery-status: completed`** — live file remains at **`docs/plans/<feature>-plan.md`**. |

See **`docs/plans/README.md`**. Agent **may** copy (not move) the plan to **`completed/`** on full completion if the human uses archives.

---

<h2 id="dr-vs-implref" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">5. Triggers vs refactor plans</h2>

| Tree | Rule |
|------|------|
| **`docs/plans/*-plan.md`** | **`delivery-resumimpl`** (this file) + **`EXECUTE_GEN.md`** |
| **`cursor_gen/refactor_plans/**`** | **`implref`** / **`resumimpl`** + **`onlyref`** |

Do not mix checklist files across those trees in one session without explicit user direction.
